   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "My dog's poop got soft after starting cooked food.",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "The switch may have been too fast, or the food may be high in moisture or fat. Switch more slowly, and if it stays soft for more than a day, talk to your vet."
   }
